        "username": "The_Justifier",
        "avatar_template": "/user_avatar/forums.greaterthangames.com/the_justifier/{size}/4954_2.png",
        "created_at": "2022-05-26T22:24:40.559Z",
        "cooked": "<p>No challenge mode or anything, so I figured that despite my having precisely one promo unlocked for these heroes (not counting Santa Guise, who I now belatedly realize would have been great for this match), this was going to be a cakewalk.  And I was almost right.  I flipped the bonus-damage drug, then damage for powers, and then Mind-Fyre; without his armor, he <em>plummeted</em> in HP, winding up at like 20.  But my luck on avoiding his armor then ran out, and I hadn’t been keeping ahead of the unplay-cards drug, so armor and Victim kills kept me from quite finishing the job, especially when I risked Requital damage and hit it, not having mathed out that the damage-for-powers drug would finish him off.</p>\n<p>Well, now that I know the order of drugs, this will definitely be a curbstomp next time.  Completionist Guise would be more fun with more promo heroes, but even then I think I tend to prefer the original.  Tough Choices is just a really hard power to match.</p>\n<p><div class=\"lightbox-wrapper\"><a class=\"lightbox\" href=\"https://forums.greaterthangames.com/uploads/default/original/2X/0/0a577bbc18d1eaad4b3bd75f3bcffd1559791a2f.jpeg\" data-download-href=\"https://forums.greaterthangames.com/uploads/default/0a577bbc18d1eaad4b3bd75f3bcffd1559791a2f\" title=\"Screenshot_20220526-170821\"><img src=\"https://forums.greaterthangames.com/uploads/default/optimized/2X/0/0a577bbc18d1eaad4b3bd75f3bcffd1559791a2f_2_225x500.jpeg\" alt=\"Screenshot_20220526-170821\" data-base62-sha1=\"1tucPixAWU07D1ivTql4KvZ7gbd\" width=\"225\" height=\"500\" srcset=\"https://forums.greaterthangames.com/uploads/default/optimized/2X/0/0a577bbc18d1eaad4b3bd75f3bcffd1559791a2f_2_225x500.jpeg, https://forums.greaterthangames.com/uploads/default/optimized/2X/0/0a577bbc18d1eaad4b3bd75f3bcffd1559791a2f_2_337x750.jpeg 1.5x, https://forums.greaterthangames.com/uploads/default/optimized/2X/0/0a577bbc18d1eaad4b3bd75f3bcffd1559791a2f_2_450x1000.jpeg 2x\" data-small-upload=\"https://forums.greaterthangames.com/uploads/default/optimized/2X/0/0a577bbc18d1eaad4b3bd75f3bcffd1559791a2f_2_10x10.png\"><div class=\"meta\">\n<svg class=\"fa d-icon d-icon-far-image svg-icon\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><use href=\"#far-image\"></use></svg><span class=\"filename\">Screenshot_20220526-170821</span><span class=\"informations\">720×1600 97.2 KB</span><svg class=\"fa d-icon d-icon-discourse-expand svg-icon\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><use href=\"#discourse-expand\"></use></svg>\n</div></a></div></p>\n<p>Edit: Yep, an easy win with non-random drug selection.  Not just my usual “screwed up and had to retry” Near Mint, but an actual in-character rematch.</p>\n<p><div class=\"lightbox-wrapper\"><a class=\"lightbox\" href=\"https://forums.greaterthangames.com/uploads/default/original/2X/9/9f860c2cbc728138d5b958c9815a6f98944ab5e5.jpeg\" data-download-href=\"https://forums.greaterthangames.com/uploads/default/9f860c2cbc728138d5b958c9815a6f98944ab5e5\" title=\"Screenshot_20220527-172031\"><img src=\"https://forums.greaterthangames.com/uploads/default/optimized/2X/9/9f860c2cbc728138d5b958c9815a6f98944ab5e5_2_225x500.jpeg\" alt=\"Screenshot_20220527-172031\" data-base62-sha1=\"mLd71N1pW26uFqWHhndeKhW1MSp\" width=\"225\" height=\"500\" srcset=\"https://forums.greaterthangames.com/uploads/default/optimized/2X/9/9f860c2cbc728138d5b958c9815a6f98944ab5e5_2_225x500.jpeg, https://forums.greaterthangames.com/uploads/default/optimized/2X/9/9f860c2cbc728138d5b958c9815a6f98944ab5e5_2_337x750.jpeg 1.5x, https://forums.greaterthangames.com/uploads/default/optimized/2X/9/9f860c2cbc728138d5b958c9815a6f98944ab5e5_2_450x1000.jpeg 2x\" data-small-upload=\"https://forums.greaterthangames.com/uploads/default/optimized/2X/9/9f860c2cbc728138d5b958c9815a6f98944ab5e5_2_10x10.png\"><div class=\"meta\">\n<svg class=\"fa d-icon d-icon-far-image svg-icon\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><use href=\"#far-image\"></use></svg><span class=\"filename\">Screenshot_20220527-172031</span><span class=\"informations\">720×1600 89.9 KB</span><svg class=\"fa d-icon d-icon-discourse-expand svg-icon\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><use href=\"#discourse-expand\"></use></svg>\n</div></a></div></p>",
